  "job_B3.2.24_20251003_114627": {
    "chunk_text": "us Nazarenus, \u00deis is h\u00e6lend se Nadzarenisca, Iudea cyning. W\u00e6s hit awriten on \u00fereo ge\u00feeode, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s on Ebrisc & on Crecisc & on L\u00e6denisc. & m\u00e6nige Iudeas \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit r\u00e6ddon, for \u00fean sio stow w\u00e6s wel neah Hierusalem \u00fe\u00e6re byrig \u00fee he on \u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea bisceopas to Pilate: Ne writ \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit \u00fe\u00e6t he sie cyning, ac writ \u00fe\u00e6t he sylfa cw\u00e6de \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Pilatus: \u00de\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6r wrat, \u00fe\u00e6t sceal swa awriten bion. \u00dea genamon hie, \u00fea milite, \u00fea hie Crist urne dryhten ahangenne h\u00e6fdon, & \u00fea tod\u00e6ldon hie his hr\u00e6gl & \u00fea gita w\u00e6s his tunuce onsundran untod\u00e6led. W\u00e6s sio tunuce syllice geworht: n\u00e6s n\u00e6nig seam on, ac w\u00e6s eall on anum awefen. \u00dea cw\u00e6don hie: Uton, la, ne toslitan \u00fea tunecan, ac utan hleotan hwylc ure hie agan scyle. & \u00fea dydon hie swa. Sceolde se witedom beon gefylled se \u00fee \u00e6r in \u00feam sealme awriten w\u00e6s & awitgod, & se halga gast W\u00e6ron \u00fea milite \u00fe\u00e6s gerefan men \u00fey \u00fe\u00e6t dydon. \u00dea stod \u00fe\u00e6r Cristes h\u00e6lendes licumlic modor, sancta Maria, & hire sweostor mid hire, & Maria \u00dea he \u00fea, Crist, of \u00fe\u00e6re rode geseah \u00fea his modor \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6tstandan & his \u00feone leofan \u00feegn, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, & \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he eft to his \u00feam le",
